      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📋 Workflow Setup\n\n### Required Credentials:\n1. **Supabase API** - Already configured\n2. **Google Gemini API** - Add in Credentials\n\n### Variables (Set in Workflow Settings):\n- `LOCAL_FILE_BASE_PATH`\n- `SOCIAL_MEDIA_OWNER_EMAIL`\n\n### How it works:\n1. Fetches talks with status \"new\"\n2. Reads metadata JSON and transcript TXT\n3. Generates content with Gemini\n4. Stores in Supabase\n5. Updates talk status",
